@startuml context-mapping-machineguard
title Context Mapping — MachineGuard (estado al 07/11/2026)

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #3A4A5A
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3A4A5A
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #5A6B7B
  FontColor #111111
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80

left to right direction

rectangle "Customer Acquisition\n<<generic>>\n[Generic Domain]" as CA #FDD9A0
rectangle "IAM\n<<supporting>>\n[Supporting Domain]" as IAM #AEE0C1
rectangle "Edge Processing\n<<supporting>>\n[Supporting Domain]" as EDGE #AEE0C1
rectangle "Environmental Monitoring\n<<core>>\n[Core Domain]" as EM #AED6F1
rectangle "Alert & Incident\nManagement\n<<core>>\n[Core Domain]" as AIM #AED6F1
rectangle "Traceability &\nQuality\n<<core>>\n[Core Domain]" as TQ #AED6F1

rectangle "ERP del Cliente\n<<external>>\n[Sistema Externo]" as ERP #D5D8DC
rectangle "OpenWeatherMap\n<<external>>\n[Sistema Externo]\n(previsto)" as OWM #D5D8DC
rectangle "Twilio\n<<external>>\n[Sistema Externo]\n(aplazado)" as TW #D5D8DC

CA -right-> IAM : C/S\nPilotRequestSubmitted
EDGE -right-> EM : C/S + OHS\nReadingCaptured
IAM -down-> EM : OHS+PL\nJWT
IAM -right-> AIM : OHS+PL\nJWT
IAM -down-> TQ : OHS+PL\nJWT
EM -right-> AIM : PL / Conf.\nDeviationDetected
EM -down-> TQ : PL / Conf.\nDeviationDetected
AIM -down-> TQ : PL / Conf.\nIncidentResolved
EM -down-> ERP : OHS+PL
TQ -down-> ERP : OHS+PL
EM .down.> OWM : Conformist\n(previsto)
AIM .down.> TW : Conformist\n(aplazado)

note as N_SEP
  Separate Ways con los BCs operativos:
  Customer Acquisition no se integra
  directamente con EM, A&I ni T&Q.
end note
CA .. N_SEP

@enduml
